ce, and the new carton replaces the old without a change on the packing line. If the existing die has a weak corner we flag it before the run rather than after."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the minimum order, and how does volume pricing work?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"500 units per SKU. Between 500 and 1,999 units the rate drops 10–15 % off the standard rate, and above 2,000 units we quote per project. There is no die-cut charge and no setup fee added afterwards. The first quote is the whole number."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How long does a run take?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A white dummy comes back in 3–5 days and a digital mockup in 24 hours, which checks the fit before anything is printed. Once artwork is approved, standard production runs 8–10 business days and a rush run 5–7. Tracking follows the job from press to loading dock."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What artwork do you need, and can you print inside?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Vector files — .AI, .PDF, .EPS or .SVG. Where only a .PNG or .JPG exists, our artwork team re-draws it for print. Inside printing uses the same plate set, and putting the reveal on the inner liner adds a pass through the press rather than a second job."}}]}]}</script><link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="128x128" href="/favicon.png"><link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/favicon.ico"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_astro/Navbar.DjCgFKZf.css"><style>.footer[data-astro-cid-jo6i4kqk]{background:linear-gradient(180deg, var(--forest-light) 0%, var(--color-forest) 100%);color:#ffffffdb;padding:clamp(3.5rem,8vw,6rem) 0 2rem}.footer-grid[data-astro-cid-jo6i4kqk]{grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr 1fr 1.3fr;gap:clamp(2rem,4vw,3.5rem);display:grid}.brand[data-astro-cid-jo6i4kqk]{align-items:center;gap:.7rem;display:inline-flex}.brand--light[data-astro-cid-jo6i4kqk] .brand-word[data-astro-cid-jo6i4kqk]{color:#fff}.brand--light[data-astro-cid-jo6i4kqk] .brand-word[data-as